<chapter num="14">
    <title>Solo Leveling</title>
    <author>Chugong</author>
    <illustrator>Jang Sung-Rak</illustrator>
    <body>
        <page pageNum="1">
            <systemMsg type="statSheet">
                <info>STATUS</info>
                <info>NAME: SUNG JIN-WOO</info>
                <level>LEVEL: 2</level>
                <info>JOB: NONE</info>
                <info>FATIGUE: 0</info>
                <info>TITLE: NONE</info>
                <info>HP: 205</info>
                <info>MP:22</info>
                <stat>STRENGTH:20</stat>
                <stat>VITALITY: 11</stat>
                <stat>AGILITY: 11</stat>
                <stat>INTELLIGENCE: 11</stat>
                <stat>SENSE: 11</stat>
                <info>REMAINING POINTS: 0</info>
            </systemMsg>
            <systemMsg type="skill">
                <info>[PASSIVE]</info>
                <info>(UNKNOWN) MAX</info>
                <info>MUSCULARITY Lv.1</info>

                <info>[ACTIVE]</info>
                <info>SPRINT Lv.1</info>
            </systemMsg>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="1" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="y" uniNum="1"/> I SEE, IF I LEVEL UP EVERY STAT GOES UP BY 1. </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="2" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> CLEARING THE DAILY QUEST GIVES ME 3 STAT POINTS. </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="3" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> LEVELING UP MEANS ALL MY STATS GO UP BY ONE, SO I GET A TOTAL OF 5
                POINTS. </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="4" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> LOOKS LIKE HUNTING MONSTERS AND LEVELING UP IS MORE EFFICIENT.
            </bubble>
        </page>

        <pageBrk/>

        <page pageNum="2">
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="5" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> HOW MUCH STRONGER DO I BECOME PER STAT POINT? </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="6" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> EVEN MY INTELLIGENCE AND SENSE CAN BE EXPRESSED BY NUMBERS. </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="7" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> THE EASIEST ONE TO UNDERSTAND IS STRENGTH... </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="8" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> IT WAS ONLY RAISED BY 10, BUT I CAN DEFINITELY FEEL THE
                IMPROVEMENTS. </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="9" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> COULD IT BE... </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="10" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> THAT MY STATS ARE WEIGHTED? </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="11" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> ANYWAYS, I CAN SEE THAT YOU GET STRONGER AS YOU LEVEL UP. </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="12" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> IT SEEMS LIKE EVEN I... </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="13" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> CAN GET STRONGER. </bubble>
        </page>

        <pageBrk/>

        <page pageNum="3">
            <caption type="thought" thtNum="1" who="Sung Jin-Woo"> AM I OVERREACTING JUST BECAUSE I
                DEFEATED TWO MONSTERS... </caption>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="14" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> DON;T THESE ONES DROP MAGICAL CORES? </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="15" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> I THOUGHT ALL MONSTERS IN A DUNGEON POSSESS A MAGICAL CORE...
                LOOKS LIKE THIS IS A DIFFERENT SPECIES ALTOGETHER THOUGH. </bubble>
            <bubble type="thought" thtNum="2" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> THE STRANGE PHENOMENON THAT OCCURED TO ME. </bubble>
            <bubble type="thought" thtNum="3" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> IF I'M BEING CONTROLLED BY THE GAME'S SYSTEM, THERE'S A HIGH
                CHANCE THAT THESE INSTANT DUNGEONS AND MONSTERS WERE ALSO SPECIALLY CREATED BY THE
                SYSTEM. </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="16" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> MAYBE THAT'S WHY THEY DROP ITEMS AND NOT MAGICAL CORES... </bubble>

            <systemMsg type="item">
                <info>[ITEM: RAIKANS'S FANG]</info>
                <info>ITEM CLASS: NONE</info>
                <info>TYPE: JUNK</info>
                <info>A LARGE AND SHARP FANG OF A RAIKAN.</info>
                <info>YOU CAN KEEP IT ON YOUR INVETORY OR SELL IT IN THE STORE.</info>
            </systemMsg>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="16" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> THERE'S EVEN A STORE IN HERE... </bubble>
        </page>

        <pageBrk/>

        <page pageNum="4">
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="17" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> WHAT DOES BUYING DO? </bubble>
            <systemMsg type="information">
                <info>ALARM</info>
                <info>-YOUR LEVEL IS NOT HIGH ENOUGH TO </info>
                <info>BUY FROM THE STORE.</info>
            </systemMsg>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="18" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> LOOKS LIKE NEW PLAYERS CAN'T USE THIS FUNCTION. </bubble>
            <systemMsg type="information">
                <info>-WOULD YOU LIKE TO SELL</info>
                <info>[ITEM: RAIKAN'S FANG]?</info>
            </systemMsg>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="19" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> YES. </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="20" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> 20 GOLD? I CAN'T TELL HOW MUCH IT'S WORTH SINCE IT'S NOT CASH. </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="21" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> THEN AGAIN, THIS DUNGEON... </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="22" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> SHOULD BE ABOUT AN E-RANK. </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="23" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> IT PROBABLY ISN'T WORTH MUCH. </bubble>
        </page>

        <pageBrk/>

        <page pageNum="5">
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="24" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> WHAT DO I DO NOW? </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="25" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> I CAN'T LEAVE UNLESS I KILL THE BOSS. </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="26" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> I COULD LEAVE IF I GOT A RETURN CRYSTAL, BUT I DON'T KNOW IF
                THAT'LL EVEN HAPPEN. </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="27" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> AND BEFORE LONG I'D LOSE MY SUPPLY OF FOOD. </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="28" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> EVEN IF THE BOSS IS E-RANK, IT'S STILL TOO MUCH FOR ME TO HANDLE
                BY MYSELF. </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="29" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> NO... SHOULDN'T IT BE POSSIBLE IF I LEVELED UP SOME MORE? </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="30" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> WELL, I COULD... </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="31" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> DIE BEFORE THEN. </bubble>
        </page>

        <pageBrk/>

        <page pageNum="6">
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="32" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> THERE'S NOTHING TO FEAR. </bubble>
        </page>

        <pageBrk/>

        <page pageNum="7">
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="33" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> I'VE ALREADY "DIED" ONCE BEFORE. </bubble>
        </page>

        <pageBrk/>

        <page pageNum="8"/>

        <pageBrk/>

        <page pageNum="9">
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="34" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> I WON'T DIE THAT EASILY! </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="35" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> SO YOU ALL SHOULDN'T DIE TOO EASILY EITHER, </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="36" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> OR I'LL FEEL SORRY... </bubble>
        </page>

        <pageBrk/>

        <page pageNum="10">
            <bubble type="thought" thtNum="4" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> FIERCELY. </bubble>
            <bubble type="thought" thtNum="5" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> FIGHT FIERCELY. </bubble>
            <bubble type="thought" thtNum="6" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> AS MUCH AS MY BODY CAN ENDURE. </bubble>
        </page>

        <pageBrk/>

        <page pageNum="11">

            <systemMsg type="information">
                <info>ALARM</info>
                <levelUp>YOU HAVE LEVELED UP!</levelUp>
            </systemMsg>
            <bubble type="thought" thtNum="7" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> I TRULY REALIZE NOW. </bubble>
            <systemMsg type="information">
                <info>ALARM</info>
                <levelUp>YOU HAVE LEVELED UP!</levelUp>
            </systemMsg>
            <bubble type="thought" thtNum="8" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> IF I QUIT HERE, I'LL GET SLAUGHTERED </bubble>
            <systemMsg type="information">
                <info>ALARM</info>
                <levelUp>YOU HAVE LEVELED UP!</levelUp>
            </systemMsg>
        </page>

        <pageBrk/>

        <page pageNum="12">
            <bubble type="thought" thtNum="9" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> IF I DIE, I CAN'T PROTECT THOSE WHO I WISH TO PROTECT! </bubble>
            <bubble type="thought" thtNum="10" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> I WILL LOSE EVERYTHING. </bubble>
            <bubble type="thought" thtNum="11" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> I CAN'T JUST KEEP MY HEAD DOWN LIKE A WEAKLING. </bubble>
        </page>

        <pageBrk/>

        <page pageNum="13">
            <bubble type="thought" thtNum="12" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> IF I CAN BECOME STRONGER... </bubble>
            <caption type="thought" thtNum="13" who="Sung Jin-Woo">I'LL EVEN FOLOW THESE BULLSHIT
                RULES!</caption>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="36" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> AHHHHHHHHHH </bubble>
            <systemMsg type="information">
                <info>ALARM</info>
                <levelUp>YOU HAVE LEVELED UP!</levelUp>
            </systemMsg>
        </page>

        <pageBrk/>

        <page pageNum="14">
            <caption type="information">STEEL FANG RAIKAN</caption>
            <caption type="information">STEEL FANG RAIKAN</caption>
            <caption type="information">STEEL FANG RAIKAN</caption>
            <caption type="information">STEEL FANG RAIKAN</caption>
            <caption type="information">STEEL FANG RAIKAN</caption>
            <caption type="information">STEEL FANG RAIKAN</caption>
            <caption type="information">STEEL FANG RAIKAN</caption>
            <caption type="information">STEEL FANG RAIKAN</caption>
            <caption type="information">STEEL FANG RAIKAN</caption>
            <caption type="information">STEEL FANG RAIKAN</caption>
        </page>

        <pageBrk/>

        <page pageNum="15">
            <systemMsg type="information">
                <info>ALARM YOU HAVE LEARNED</info>
                <info>[TITLE: WOLF SLAYER]</info>
            </systemMsg>
        </page>
    </body>
</chapter>
